 superior, green =\u000ainferior, yellow = lateral, and orange = medial. No masses or other lesions\u000aare present. The specimen is entirely submitted from lateral to medial.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast, mult frags, ESS\u000aPart two, labeled "#2. right breast scar tissue", consists of a skin ellipse\u000a(1.5 x REMOVED_DATE cm), and underlying fibroadipose tissue (0.8 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 cm in depth).\u000aThe specimen is entirely submitted.\u000aMicro 18: right breast soft tissue, 1 frag, ESS\u000afm\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN- OTHER THAN CYST, TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT\u000a[report_end]
