e fragments, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior margin, perpendicular sections, multiple fragments, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral margin, perpendicular sections, multiple fragments, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial and anterior/skin margins, perpendicular sections, multiple\u000afragments, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  posterior margin, perpendicular sections, multiple fragments, ESS.\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE\u000a[report_end]
