d, sequentially from\u000amedial to lateral, with medial margin in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID, lateral margin in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID, and area of\u000ainterest per localizing wire in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Entire specimen, sequentially from medial to lateral, multi\u000afrags, ESS.\u000aDB/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Hejin P Hahn M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a6/3/2007\u000aSURGICAL ADDENDUM:\u000aThere is no malignancy seen upon microscopic examination of the specimen,\u000aincluding margins.\u000aAddendum #1 by Hejin P Hahn M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
