sses, lesions or other abnormalities noted grossly.\u000aAdditional representative sections are taken from left breast tissue.\u000aMicro 3,4: Skin and fibrofatty tissue, 4 fragments, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Additional fibrofatty tissue, 2 frags each, RSS.\u000adb\u000aReports to: ORGILL, DENNIS, PAUL M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000a[report_end]
