00athat contains multiple areas of firm, indurated, gritty, light grey, suspicious\u000asoft tissue, in maximal size measuring REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aMICRO #9-11: Entirety of the second specimen, mult frags, 3 cass, ESS.\u000aReports to: DAVIS, SALLIE, KEENE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
