VAccession Number: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID Report Status: Final\u000aType: Surgical Pathology\u000aPathology Report REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000aAccessioned On: REMOVED_DATE \u000aGLICKMAN, JONATHAN, NEIL, M.D.~PH.D.\u000aDIAGNOSIS: by GLICKMAN,JONATHAN NEIL,M.D.,PH.D.\u000aRIGHT BREAST, WIRE-LOCALIZED EXCISION FOR A MASS:\u000aAtypical ductal hyperplasia involving a fibroepithelial lesion (0.6 cm)\u000a(see NOTE).\u000aBiopsy site changes are present associated with the lesion.\u000aThe lesion is focally present at the margin (not oriented).\u000aThe stroma is moderately cellular, with minimal nuclear pleomorphism.\u000aNo mitoses are seen. No stromal overgrowth is present. The border is\u000apoorly defined, and stromal cells appear to penetrate into adjacent\u000aadipose tissue.\u000aNOTE:\u000aThe atypical ductal hyperplasia is marked and areas suggestive of pagetoid\u000aspread are present. Partial involvement of the lesion by an adjacent area of\u000aDCIS cannot be excluded given the proximity of the lesion to the margin. In\u000aaddition, the associated stroma has an infiltrative pattern of concern for a\u000alow grade phyllodes tumor. Reviewed by Dr. S. Lester and Dr. A. Richardson,\u000aBreast Pathology Service.\u000aCLINICAL DATA:\u000aHistory: None given.\u000aOperation: Rt wire directed breast bx.\u000aTISSUE SUBMITTED: 1. Rt breast tissue.\u000aRADIOLOGY: Mass seen in specimen. TP\u000aGROSS DESCRIPTION: by RIVERA,MIGUEL N,M.D.\u000aThe specimen is received fresh in one part, labeled with the patient's name and\u000amedical record number. The specimen consists of a single fragment of\u000afibroadipose tissue (2.5 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 cm). There is a wire in the specimen and\u000aaccompanying radiograph showing a mass in the specimen. The specimen is\u000aapproximately 80% fibrous tissue and 20% adipose tissue. The specimen is not\u000aoriented. The margins are inked black. There is an area of hemorrhage with a\u000asmall cavity (0.3 cm) in the fibrous tissue. The specimen is entirely\u000asubmitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  entire specimen, 8 frags, ESS.\u000amir\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
