sterior, inferior, superior,\u000alateral and medial margins, 16 frags, ESS.\u000aMICRO #14: Skin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
