unit number.\u000aThe first part, labeled "#1", consists of a single fragment of yellow\u000afibrofatty tissue (4.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) with a localization wire in place.\u000aThere is a single, REMOVED_DATE cm, firm, tan area sampled in FSA. The remaining breast\u000aparenchyma is fibrotic and focally hemorrhagic with no discreet lesions.\u000aMicro 1: FSRA, ESS, 1 frag.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Remaining tissue, ESS, multi frag.\u000aThe next part, labeled "#2 right breast mass", consists of a single fragment of\u000afibrofatty tissue (2.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm). The tissue is slightly fibrotic with\u000ano focal lesions.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Right breast mass, ESS, 3 frag.\u000akb\u000aReports to: HAIGH, LINDA, SANDERS M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
