avity, RSS, 5 frag, 5 cass.\u000aMicro 8: Additional superior tissue, RSS, 1 frag, 1 cass.\u000aMicro 9: Additional anterior tissue next to biopsy cavity, RSS, 1 frag, 1 cass\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Additional superior tissue, ESS, mult frag, 7 cass.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Additional inferior tissue, ESS, mult frag, 7 cass.\u000amm\u000aReports to: GARCIA, JOSE, PEREZ M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: LUMPECTOMY\u000a[report_end]
