REMOVED_DATE cm of the medial margin and REMOVED_DATE cm\u000aof the lateral margin. The remaining tissue consists of approximately 75%\u000ahemorrhagic to yellow/tan fibroadipose tissue and 25% fibrous stroma. The\u000aspecimen is accompanied by a radiograph.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, sequentially from lateral to medial,\u000amultiple frags, ESS.\u000aDFI/mmm\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jonathan N Glickman M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a4/24/2006\u000a[report_end]
