icro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, level 6, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, level 7, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, level 8, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, level 9, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, levels REMOVED_DATE  3 frags, ESS.\u000aAF/elw\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Ann K Folkins M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000a12/21/2005\u000a[report_end]
