d the calcifications are in block #4. The specimen radiograph is reviewed\u000aand reveals a cluster of calcifications and the localization wire.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast specimen, multi frags, ESS.\u000aqqd\u000aReports to: WHANG, EDWARD, E. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
