ire hook, radially, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Sequential cross sections, 1 frag each, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Opposite unoriented end, radially, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aCP/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Gilbert Brodsky M.D., Electronically signed on Wednesday\u000aREMOVED_MONTH 03, 2008 at 05:32:45PM\u000a[report_end]
