D_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm white/tan firm\u000afocally cystic well-circumscribed lesion abutting the superior, posterior and\u000ainferior surfaces and extends to within less than REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest\u000ainferior, lateral, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest medial margin. The specimen is\u000aentirely submitted.\u000aMicro 1: lateral margin, perpendicular, 5 frags ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections lateral to medial, 6 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, perpendicular, 8 frags, ESS\u000ajhc\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
