d in 1 cassette designated "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID". Frozen section B is entirely\u000asubmitted in 1 cassette designated "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID". The larger fragment is submitted\u000aentirely in 17 cassettes designated "L". The smaller fragment is submitted\u000aentirely in 5 cassettes designated "S".\u000aThe specimen labeled "left axillary cyst wall", consists of 8 cc. of\u000agreen/black colored fluid which is centrifuged to yield cytologic preparations\u000a(REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID). The remaining cell pellet, measuring REMOVED_DATE  x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm., is\u000asubmitted in Bouin's for cell block sections. Specimen labeled "CB", 1\u000afragment 1 cassette, ESS.\u000aReports to: BLOTNER, KENNETH, ELLIOT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST,NOS\u000a[report_end]
