r/red;\u000ainferior/green; lateral/yellow; medial/orange. An accompanying radiograph\u000ademonstrates an embedded localization wire but no obvious calcifications.\u000aSectioning reveals fibrofatty breast tissue with no focal lesions.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: 1 frag each, ESS.\u000aVIV/elw\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Vijay K Vanguri M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Xiaohua Qian M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a4/29/2005\u000a[report_end]
