docervical curettings", is an aggregate of Bouin's\u000astained tissue submitted in 1 cassette labeled "EC".\u000aSpecimen #4 labeled "endometrial curettings" is an aggregate of Bouin's\u000astained tissue submitted in 1 cassette labeled "EM".\u000aReports to: KANE, J.GREGORY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
