ule\u000a(1.7 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) which is grossly abutting the superior/posterior margins.\u000aThe entire specimen is submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Firm nodule, slices 1 and 2, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Slice 3, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Slice 4, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Slice 5, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 11: Slice 6, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 12: Slice 7, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 13: Slice 8, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Slice 9, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Remainder of specimen, mult frags, ESS.\u000ajoc\u000aReports to: LOCKHART, DIANE, CATHERINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
