f yellow/tan to red, focally hemorrhagic fibrofatty\u000asoft tissue cores.\u000aMicro 1: "B", multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  unlabeled blue cassettes, mult frags each, ESS.\u000adfi\u000aReports to: DENISON, CHRISTINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
