s for invasive carcinoma are identified. The specimen is\u000aentirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue, 10 frags, ESS.\u000aeab\u000aReports to: LOCKHART, DIANE, CATHERINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
