ty, RSS, 3 frags, 3 cass.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - lateral margin, ESS, multiple frags, 3 cass.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - medial portion, RSS, multiple frags, 2 cass.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - cephalad portion, RSS, multiple frags, 2 cass.\u000aNOTE: 75% of the biopsy is submitted.\u000aReports to: SHIRLEY, ROBERT, LAWRENCE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
