u000aunstained).\u000aThe slides are labeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and sublabeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID",\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID unstained"(REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID), "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID SMA", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID NEG" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID",\u000acorresponding to B) right breast, 11:30, needle localized excision (3.5 x REMOVED_DATE x\u000a1 cm) C) left breast needle localized excision (5 x 4 x 1 cm) performed on ,\u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
