E cm of the lateral\u000asurface, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the anterior surface. The entire specimen is\u000asubmitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  slice 1, posterior-most slice, perpendicular, 13 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 4&5: slice 2, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 6&7: slice 3, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 8&9: slice 4, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 10&11: slice 5, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 12&13: slice 6, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 14&15: slice 7, 3 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  slice 8, anterior-most slice, perpendicular, 12 frags, ESS.\u000ajhc\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
