mass, 9 frags, ESS.\u000aAn accompanying radiogram demonstrates the presence of calcificiations and a\u000alocalizing wire within the specimen.\u000adk\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
