o unoriented tan/yellow tissue fragments (1.4 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm).\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - right breast mass, 6 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - additional fragments, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aPart B, labeled "right breast mass", consists of five unoriented fragments of\u000ayellow/tan fibroadipose tissue (3.4 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate).\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - right breast mass, 6 frags, ESS.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Christopher P Crum M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aAmendment #1 by Christopher P Crum M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
