ly. The blocks\u000aare radiographed and the calcifications identified in block 13.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast biopsy, mult frags, ESS\u000amcm\u000aReports to: WHANG, EDWARD, E. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
