cimen is composed of firm white fibrous tissue. The specimen is\u000aentirely submitted from medial to lateral.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, perpendicular, 8 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections, mult frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral margin, perpendicular, 7 frags, ESS\u000apsc\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
