agments of soft tissue.\u000aMicro #4: Tissue on implant, ESS, 2 frag.\u000aReports to: O'CONNOR, NICHOLAS, EDWARD M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST IMPLANT\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN, NOS\u000a[report_end]
