ION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", corresponding to a left breast excisions A) lower outer quadrant (4.0 x\u000a3.0 x REMOVED_DATE cm) B) 11 o'clock (2.4 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE \u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Michael W Bennett M.B., B.C.H., Electronically signed on\u000a5/10/2007\u000a[report_end]
