nked per\u000apathology protocol for the evaluation of margins: posterior = black; anterior\u000a= blue; superior = red; inferior = green; lateral = yellow; medial = orange.\u000aMicro 2: region designated as divided duct by surgeon, 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro 3: nodular focus, 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  tissue deep to divided duct, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro 6: firm tissue at medial margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 7: posterior margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aeab\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
