om the superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the inferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the\u000aanterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the posterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the lateral\u000amargin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial margin.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Superior margin, perpendicular, 7 frags total, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Specimen serially sectioned from superior to inferior, 1 frag\u000aeach, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Inferior margin, perpendicular, 6 frags, ESS.\u000aDCP/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: BS-08-REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jeffrey F Krane M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a2/25/2008\u000a[report_end]
