ose tissue without other pathology. The\u000aspecimen is entirely submitted for microscopic examination.\u000aMicro 1: superior margin, perpendicular, multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 2: inferior margin, perpendicular, mutli frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  rest of breast specimen, submitted superior to inferior, micro\u000a#4 with area of clip, multi frags, ESS.\u000adwu\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
