logic\u000aexamination. No areas suspicious for invasive carcinoma is identified.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue around wire, multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  representative section of remainder of breast tissue, multi\u000afrags, RSS.\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
