N_ID: Right breast, white cassette, green lid cores, multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart B, "#2. Second location, blue top, white bottom", consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE cm aggregate of cores of fibroadipose tissue, received in a white\u000acassette with a blue lid.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Left breast, white cassette, blue lid cores, multi frags, ESS.\u000aDB/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a7/24/2008\u000a[report_end]
