 x REMOVED_DATE cm) obtained on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying pathology\u000areport bearing the patient's name.\u000aReports to: BELLON, JENNIFER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: OUTSIDE SLIDE CONSULT - BREAST\u000a[report_end]
