VED_DATE th Street, West Palm\u000aBeach, FL, REMOVED_CASE_ID, are eight glass slides.\u000aOne slide is labeled "PA:S-835-99" and sublabeled "1 1 Rc", corresponding to\u000aa right breast needle biopsy collected on REMOVED_DATE  according to the\u000aaccompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. A consultation\u000areport from Dr. PP Rosen (White Plains Medical Center; REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID; REMOVED_DATE )\u000aconcerning this case is also received.\u000aFour slides are labeled "PA:S-1002-99" and sublabeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 1 Rc", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 1 Rc", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID\u000a1 Rc" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 1 Rc", corresponding to two left breast biopsies performed on\u000a4/12/99, according to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's\u000aname.\u000aOne slide is labeled "PA:S-2099-99" and sublabeled "9 1 Rc", corresponding to a\u000aright breast biopsy performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying\u000apathology report bearing the patient's name. A consultation report from Dr. PP\u000aRosen (The New York Hospital - Cornell Medical Center; REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID; REMOVED_DATE )\u000aconcerning this case is also received.\u000aTwo slides are labeled "PA:S-3144-99" and sublabeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 1 Rc" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID 1 Rc",\u000acorresponding to two right breast biopsies collected on REMOVED_DATE  according to\u000athe accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: OUTSIDE SLIDE CONSULT - BREAST\u000a[report_end]
