l margins, 5 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Anterior, 3 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Inferior, 5 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 12: Lateral, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 13: Deep, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Very fibrotic area, anterior medial, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aref\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
