or margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 9: additional margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 10: inferior margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 11: yellow-inked margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 12: representative skin, 3 frags, RSS.\u000aref\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
