e lateral margins.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left breast biopsy tissue (micro #3, 6, 9, & 10 contain the skin\u000aellipse), 19 frags, ESS.\u000amjy\u000aReports to: IGLEHART, JAMES, DIRK M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
