 = orange. The specimen is entirely submitted from\u000amedial to lateral.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  specimen entirely submitted, 20 frags, ESS.\u000afm\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
