Micro REMOVED_DATE  REMOVED_DATE -3-3 frags, ESS.\u000aPart five, labeled "#5. Breast tissue medial to all previous specimens",\u000aconsists of two fragments of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm\u000a(inked blue) and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm (inked green). Due to the fragmented\u000anature of this specimen, true margins are not evaluable.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  4 frags each, ESS.\u000aviv\u000aReports to: KANE, GREGORY, J. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
