gin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the other nodule. A\u000aclip is identified.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Left breast tissue serially sectioned to include the two nodules\u000ain micro 4 and area of the clip in micro 5, 15 frags, ESS.\u000ajgi\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
