000abiopsy (2.2 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying\u000apathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aIncluded are two (2) lab reports from Genzyme Genetics-Manhattan, New York, NY;\u000aone report is numbered "09-REMOVED_CASE_ID-MH" and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to\u000aimmunohistochemistry studies performed on block "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" the specimen listed above;\u000aand the second report is numbered "09-REMOVED_CASE_ID-MH" and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring\u000ato immunohistochemistry studies performed on block "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" from the case listed\u000aabove, bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on Monday\u000aREMOVED_MONTH 22, 2009 at 12:05:49PM\u000a[report_end]
