ions are identified. H: firm area I: area adjacent to the guide wire J,K: rest of the specimen Resident: ANUPAMA GUPTA, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST (LEFT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY #1 PART B: BREAST (LEFT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY #2
