tiple small cysts, varying in size up to 2 mm. The cysts contain light pink, otherwise clear fluid. Ten representative sections of the parenchyma are submitted. SECTION CODE: N-W: representative parenchyma, left breast X-AA: lateral, superior, medial, inferior margins, respectively BB: nipple, left breast CC: scar, right breast DD: nipple, right breast Resident: Rex Neal Smith, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-INPATIENT (FLR.UNKNOWN) REPORTS TO: Edwin Lee Carter, M.D. John D Mitchell, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT) PART B: BREAST (LEFT)\u000a[report_end]
