imen is inked black and the deep half, blue. The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted from superficial to deep in cassettes H-M. Gross Description by: SHANNON SCHUTZ Resident: MELINDA J. FAN, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST (LEFT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (LEFT "SUB-AREOLAR DUCT"), EXCISION\u000a[report_end]
