l in cassettes A-G. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "superior medial", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm portion of fibrofatty soft tissue, with one irregular and shaggy surface and a glistening surface. The glistening surface is inked black, the specimen is serially sectioned is submitted in its entirety in cassettes H-I. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "lateral", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm irregular tan-yellow portion of fibrofatty soft tissue, which has a shaggy surface and a smooth surface. The smooth surface is inked black an the specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassette J. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "inferior", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm irregular tan-yellow fragment of fibrofatty soft tissue with one shaggy surface and a smooth surface. The smooth surface is inked black, the specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassettes K and L. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "deep", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm tan-yellow fragment of fibrofatty soft tissue. One surface is shaggy and the opposite surface is smooth. The smooth surface is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in entirety in cassette M. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "anterior", are multiple irregular tan-yellow fragments, ranging from REMOVED_DATE cm to REMOVED_DATE cm, which are submitted in toto in cassette N. Gross Description by: RYAN W. SCHNIEDERJAN Resident: NORMA RODRIGUEZ, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST(RIGHT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST(RIGHT,FINAL SUPER MEDIAL MARGIN),EXCISIONAL PART C: BREAST(RIGHT,FINAL LATERAL MARGIN),EXCISIONAL BIOP PART D: BREAST(RIGHT,FINAL INFERIOR MARGIN),EXCISIONAL BIO PART E: BREAST(RIGHT,FINAL DEEP MARGIN),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART F: BREAST(RIGHT,FINAL ANTERIOR MARGIN),EXCISIONAL BIO
