al scattered areas of dense fibrosis and no lesion suspicious for invasion. The specimen is entirely submitted in Cassettes A-I. Gross Description by: SAMANTHA J. PULLIAM, MD Resident: JEROME T. O'CONNELL JR., MD *** INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS *** GROSS DIAGNOSIS #1: (BREAST (LEFT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY): NO LESION GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE TUMOR IS IDENTIFIED. O.R. Resident: SAMANTHA J. PULLIAM, MD O.R. Diagnosis by: John H. Eichhorn, M.D. =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michael Ned Margolies, M.D. PART : BREAST(LEFT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY\u000a[report_end]
