ll thickness section, bisected, area designated by wire. H: Anterior margin, area designated by wire. I: Anterior, superior, inferior margins, area designated by wire. J: Anterior, superior margins, area designated by wire. K-L: Full thickness section, bisected, area designated by wire. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "right breast additional deep tissue" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm tan-yellow, focally cauterized lobular adipose tissue which is submitted in toto in cassette M. Gross Description by: CHRISTINE D'AMATO Resident: ELENA BRACHTEL, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST(RIGHT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (RIGHT, ADDITIONAL DEEP), EXCISION
