n size from REMOVED_DATE to REMOVED_DATE cm in diameter. Section Code A - nipple B - scar C,D - previous biopsy site E-L - random sections from breast M-Q - lymph nodes Resident: Robin E. Kirby, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-INPATIENT (FLR.UNKNOWN) REPORTS TO: Herbert Charles Hoover Jr., M.D. PART : LEFT BREAST MASTECTOMY\u000a[report_end]
