Y L. DAVIS, MD., Ph.D. O.R. Diagnosis by: Joseph Misdraji, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-INPATIENT (FLR.UNKNOWN) REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. Jonathan Michael Winograd, M.D. PART A: LYMPH NODE (SENTINEL RIGHT AXILLA), EXCISION PART B: BREAST(RIGHT),SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART C: BREAST(RIGHT AXILLARY,ADDITIONAL),EXCISION PART D: BREAST(RIGHT,ADDITIONAL UPPER OUTER QUADRANT),EXCI
