gin (closest margin). The remainder of the tissue is unremarkable. Representative sections are submitted as follows: A: lateral portion anterior superior (lateral margin) B: lateral portion anterior inferior C: lateral posterior portion superior D: lateral portion posterior inferior E: middle portion anterior superior F: middle portion anterior inferior G: middle portion posterior superior H: middle portion posterior inferior I: medial portion anterior superior (medial margin) J: medial portion anterior inferior K: medial portion posterior superior L: medial portion posterior inferior (closest margin). Resident: DAVID COON, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART : BREAST (RIGHT "MASS"), RE-EXCISION
