h superior, long stitch lateral) REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm fibrofatty breast tissue. The specimen is inked (anterior blue, posterior black, superior green, inferior yellow) and serially sectioned displaying a fibrofatty focally hemorrhagic cut surface. The specimen is entirely submitted sequentially from lateral to medial in cassettes K-S. Also received in the same container are three irregular fibrofatty breast tissues ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm, which are inked black, serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes T-V. Gross Description by: JAMES BARRY Resident: AQING ('AHCHEAN') CHEN, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST(LEFT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST(RIGHT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY
