dle biopsy: Atypical lobular hyperplasia. Focal calcifications. B. Right breast, upper #2, needle biopsy: Benign breast parenchyma with focal apocrine metaplasia. Focal duct ectasia. Focal calcification (oxalate type). Final Diagnosis by: Dennis J. Feen, M.D. Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 1153 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 1248 PAT.MURJ Notes: REMOVED_DATE  all 27 slides and BIDMC report rec'd /djd CR REMOVED_DATE  Sent all 27 slides to Dr. Stuart Schnitt @ BI Deac Med Center via courier at the req of Dr. Michelle Specht & Auerbach Breast Center DJF/jam (CO) Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 0704 PAT.MURJ REMOVED_DATE  - 1245 PAT.DORDCODES: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Breast, NOS-Apocrine metapl REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Right breast, N-Benign REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Right breast, N-Atypical lobula BREANBX - -BREANBX REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Duct, NOS-Dilatation, NOS REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Duct, NOS-Calcium deposit REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - Duct, NOS-Oxalate salt, N Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 1408 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 1153 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 1248 PAT.MURJCOPIES TO: PATERSON,JENNIFER C. M.D. 173 WORCESTER ST. WELLESLEY, MA REMOVED_CASE_ID (781)237-1020 RUBENS,JAMI R. M.D. RADIOLOGY DEPARTMENT NEWTON, MA REMOVED_CASE_ID (617)243-6600MARKERS: Breast Disease Related, Consult Case Out, Consult Case Return Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 1408 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 0703 PAT.MURJ REMOVED_DATE  - 1245 PAT.DORDPROCEDURES: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID (12/20/07-1153 PAT.DORD) Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 1408 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 1153 PAT.DORD REMOVED_DATE  - 1248 PAT.MURJTISSUES: A. Breast, needle biopsy - right #1 B. Breast, needle biopsy - right #2 Edited by: REMOVED_DATE  - 1408 PAT.DORDFinal: FEEN,DENNIS J. M.D. * REMOVED_DATE  <12/21/07-1307> by MD.FEED --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
